MIMED2024
=========

Motor Imagery MIMED dataset from Wirawan et al. 2024 [1]_.

Dataset Overview
----------------
  Code: MIMED2024
  Paradigm: imagery
  DOI: 10.1016/j.dib.2024.110833
  Subjects: 30
  Sessions per subject: 2
  Events: left_hand=1, right_hand=2, trunk=3
  Trial interval: [0, 4] s
  Runs per session: 6
  File format: MAT (converted from EDF)

Acquisition
-----------
  Sampling rate: 128.0 Hz
  Number of channels: 14
  Channel types: eeg=14
  Channel names: AF3, F7, F3, FC5, T7, P7, O1, O2, P8, T8, FC6, F4, F8, AF4
  Montage: standard_1020
  Hardware: Emotiv EPOC X
  Reference: CMS/DRL (P3/P4)
  Ground: DRL
  Sensor type: saline felt (Ag/AgCl)
  Line frequency: 50.0 Hz

Participants
------------
  Number of subjects: 30
  Health status: healthy
  Gender distribution: male=16, female=14

Experimental Protocol
---------------------
  Paradigm: imagery
  Number of classes: 3
  Class labels: left_hand, right_hand, trunk
  Stimulus type: video
  Mode: offline

